Reading: with floor=26 (> the scenario's dst_height=24), H26 takes the exact same serial branch
G takes at this scenario, so G vs H26 is a wash on both axes (as expected - literally the same
code path). But this throws away the entire multi-core win 035 (E) established for CatmullRom at
this scenario: E vs H26 multi-core is a +71.5% regression, 0/5 pairs favoring H26 - i.e. raising
the floor high enough to matter at dst_height=24 reintroduces candidate 034's already-measured
multi-core regression almost exactly.
